---
import type { Locale } from "../i18n";

interface Props {
  locale?: Locale;
}

const { locale = "en" } = Astro.props;
const pt = locale === "pt-BR";
---

<figure class="boosting-sequence">
  <div
    class="boosting-sequence-diagram"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="boosting-sequence-title boosting-sequence-description"
  >
    <span id="boosting-sequence-title" class="sr-only">
      {pt
        ? "Um modelo de gradient boosting cresce por meio de correções sequenciais de árvores"
        : "A gradient boosting model grows through sequential tree corrections"}
    </span>
    <span id="boosting-sequence-description" class="sr-only">
      {pt
        ? "A predição inicial F zero é combinada com uma primeira árvore ajustada ao que F zero ainda não captura, produzindo F um. Uma segunda árvore se ajusta ao que F um ainda não captura, produzindo F dois. A repetição desse processo produz o modelo final F M."
        : "The initial prediction F zero is combined with a first tree fitted to what F zero misses, producing F one. A second tree fits what F one still misses, producing F two. Repeating this process produces the final model F M."}
    </span>

    <div class="model-state model-state-initial">
      <strong>F<sub>0</sub>(x)</strong>
      <span>{pt ? "predição inicial" : "initial prediction"}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="tree-correction" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="plus">+</span>
      <div class="tree-term">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 72 54">
          <path d="M36 8v12M36 20 18 34M36 20l18 14M18 34v11M54 34v11" />
          <circle cx="36" cy="8" r="4" />
          <circle cx="18" cy="45" r="4" />
          <circle cx="54" cy="45" r="4" />
        </svg>
        <span>{pt ? <>ajusta o que F<sub>0</sub> não captura</> : <>fits what F<sub>0</sub> misses</>}</span>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow arrow-wide">→</span>
      <span class="arrow arrow-narrow">↓</span>
    </div>

    <div class="model-state">
      <strong>F<sub>1</sub>(x)</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="tree-correction" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="plus">+</span>
      <div class="tree-term">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 72 54">
          <path d="M36 8v12M36 20 18 34M36 20l18 14M18 34v11M54 34v11" />
          <circle cx="36" cy="8" r="4" />
          <circle cx="18" cy="45" r="4" />
          <circle cx="54" cy="45" r="4" />
        </svg>
        <span>{pt ? <>ajusta o que F<sub>1</sub> não captura</> : <>fits what F<sub>1</sub> misses</>}</span>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow arrow-wide">→</span>
      <span class="arrow arrow-narrow">↓</span>
    </div>

    <div class="model-state">
      <strong>F<sub>2</sub>(x)</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="sequence-continues" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>· · ·</span>
      <span class="arrow arrow-wide">→</span>
      <span class="arrow arrow-narrow">↓</span>
    </div>

    <div class="model-state model-state-final">
      <strong>F<sub>M</sub>(x)</strong>
      <span>{pt ? "modelo final" : "final model"}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    {pt
      ? "Cada nova árvore se ajusta ao que o modelo atual ainda não captura, criando o modelo seguinte."
      : "Each new tree fits what the current model still misses, creating the next model."}
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    clip-path: inset(50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .boosting-sequence {
    width: 100%;
    margin: 42px 0 52px;
  }

  .boosting-sequence-diagram {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(78px, 0.85fr) minmax(126px, 1.35fr) minmax(78px, 0.85fr) minmax(126px, 1.35fr) minmax(78px, 0.85fr) 52px minmax(78px, 0.85fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 18px 0 20px;
  }

  .model-state,
  .tree-term {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .model-state {
    gap: 7px;
  }

  .model-state strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .model-state span,
  .tree-term span {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .model-state-final strong {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .tree-correction {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
  }

  .tree-term {
    gap: 5px;
  }

  .tree-term svg {
    width: 62px;
    color: var(--accent);
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .tree-term path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-width: 1.7;
  }

  .tree-term circle {
    fill: var(--surface-raised);
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.7;
  }

  .plus,
  .arrow,
  .sequence-continues {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .plus {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .arrow {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .arrow-narrow {
    display: none;
  }

  .sequence-continues {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-around;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  figcaption {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .boosting-sequence {
      margin: 34px 0 42px;
    }

    .boosting-sequence-diagram {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 8px 0 18px;
    }

    .tree-correction {
      grid-template-columns: auto auto;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px 15px;
    }

    .tree-term {
      grid-column: 2;
    }

    .tree-correction .arrow {
      grid-column: 2;
      justify-self: center;
    }

    .sequence-continues {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .arrow-wide {
      display: none;
    }

    .arrow-narrow {
      display: inline;
    }

    .model-state span,
    .tree-term span {
      font-size: 0.68rem;
    }
  }
</style>
